kanban
  %% Kanban: work flows across the board; one card gets stuck in review
  Todo
    spec[Write the spec]
    docs[Update the docs]
  Doing
    api[Build the API]
  Review
  Done
    plan[Plan the release]

animate
  step "The API is built and goes to review"
    move api to Review
  step "The spec is picked up"
    move spec to Doing
  step "Review finds a problem"
    mark api warn
    badge api "changes requested" as warn
  step "Fixed: both land in Done"
    mark api clear
    badge api clear
    move api, spec to Done each
